================================================================================
PROJECT NOTES - EMPLOYEE TIME CLOCK APP
================================================================================

A simple, beginner-friendly Android app that lets employees clock in and out,
track their work hours, and lets managers view attendance reports and set
employee shifts.

Built with: Kotlin + Android (XML layouts, Activities), no Jetpack Compose,
no Firebase - data is stored in memory (DataManager singleton).

