2. OVERVIEW - WHAT EACH PAGE/FILE DOES
================================================================================

SPLASH SCREEN (SplashActivity.kt + activity_splash.xml)
- Shows "Employee Time Clock" title on a blue background for 1.5 seconds.
- Then automatically navigates to LoginActivity.

LOGIN SCREEN (LoginActivity.kt + activity_login.xml)
- User enters email and password.
- On login, app checks if email matches a demo employee.
- Routes to MainActivity (employee) or ManagerActivity (manager) based on role.
- Links to RegisterActivity and ForgotPasswordActivity.

REGISTER SCREEN (RegisterActivity.kt + activity_register.xml)
- User enters name, email, password, confirm password.
- Validates fields and password match.
- Creates a new Employee and saves it in DataManager.
- Returns to Login screen after success.

FORGOT PASSWORD SCREEN (ForgotPasswordActivity.kt + activity_forgot_password.xml)
- User enters email to reset password.
- Shows a toast message (placeholder - no real email sending).
- Finishes and returns to Login.

EMPLOYEE DASHBOARD (MainActivity.kt + activity_main.xml)
- Shows welcome message with employee name.
- CLOCK IN button - records clock-in time.
- CLOCK OUT button - records clock-out time and calculates hours worked.
- Shows "Hours worked today" total.

MANAGER DASHBOARD (ManagerActivity.kt + activity_manager.xml)
- Shows Present / Absent employee counts for today.
- Period filter: Today or This Month.
- Employee list - tap any employee to open shift-setting dialog.
- Attendance reports list - shows all clock records with hours.
- Refresh button to reload data.

SHIFT DIALOG (dialog_shift.xml)
- Popup shown when manager taps an employee.
- Lets manager set Shift Start and Shift End times for that employee.

DATA MODELS:
- Employee.kt - id, name, email, role, shiftStart, shiftEnd
- AttendanceRecord.kt - id, employeeId, employeeName, date, clockIn, clockOut, hoursWorked
- Shift.kt - employeeId, startTime, endTime

DATA MANAGER:
- DataManager.kt - Singleton that holds all employees, attendance records, and shifts in memory.
- Seeds demo data on first use.

